  "behavior": [
    "Variable virtual lists clamp against their actual viewport before item positioning, including short/equal content and resize.",
    "DataTable.fill_parent(true) fits a bounded parent with natural controls and an external footer; default sizing is preserved. Header, skeleton, cached rows and vertical body restrict scrolling to their intended axis.",
    "Dropdown actions and focus reflect the live menu session; queued, duplicate, disabled and unpaired-key actions are rejected. Pointer actions use actual popup bounds and retired owners release.",
    "ScrollBar exports working Focus/Increment/Decrement/numeric SetValue handlers. IDs bind keyed handle identity and axis; rebind retires old actions/drag. Actions use current ranges, finite values and the current step, preserving the other axis."
  ],
